### ─── AUTH ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### SIGNUP
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "souleima",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "souleima@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "phone": "0612345678"
}

###

### LOGIN
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "souleima@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password@123"
}

###

### LOGIN ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "leila@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### FORGOT PASSWORD
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "souleima@gmail.com"
}

###

### RESET PASSWORD
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJlbWFpbCI6InNvdWxlaW1hQGdtYWlsLmNvbSIsImlhdCI6MTc3MzY3ODkwMiwiZXhwIjoxNzczNjgyNTAyfQ.68Tv0cTW1VTgNQ71bLgZBURTOYmR3qQPmfUhbEuVALA",
  "password": "NewPassword@123"
}

###

### CONFIRM EMAIL
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/confirm-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "REPLACE_WITH_VERIFICATION_TOKEN"
}

###

### RESEND CONFIRMATION (protected)
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/resend-confirmation
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_JWT_TOKEN

###

### GET CURRENT USER (protected)
GET http://localhost:8080/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_JWT_TOKEN

###

### ─── USERS (ADMIN ONLY) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### GET ALL USERS
GET http://localhost:8080/users
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

###

### GET USER BY ID
GET http://localhost:8080/users/1
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

###

### CREATE USER
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@gmail.com",
  "password": "Password@123",
  "phone": "0612345679",
  "role": "client"
}

###

### UPDATE USER
PATCH http://localhost:8080/users/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "phone": "0698765432"
}

###

### DELETE USER
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/1
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN

###

### TOGGLE ACTIVE
PATCH http://localhost:8080/users/1/toggle-active
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN